# Templates the Combat Manager NPCs apply, written from the rules on Archives of Nethys (aonprd.com)

Seeded ~ Tendrils	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Extraordinary.Attack	VISIBLE:DISPLAY	DESC:Two secondary tendril attacks that deal damage as a tentacle one size category larger, with grab and +5 ft. reach. Its natural weapons count as magic and evil. It counts as both undead and plant for effects that target a creature type. +4 bonus on saves against mind-affecting effects.	SOURCEPAGE:p.90
Seeded ~ Death Burst	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Extraordinary.Attack	VISIBLE:DISPLAY	DESC:When it dies, it releases psychic spores that expose adjacent creatures to seedborne consumption.	SOURCEPAGE:p.90
Seeded ~ Entrapping Tendrils	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Extraordinary.Attack	VISIBLE:DISPLAY	DESC:After a successful pin, it can tie up the foe as a swift action; up to two creatures at once, each costing a tendril attack. Tendrils have hardness 5 and 10 hp and regrow after 1 minute.	SOURCEPAGE:p.90
Seeded ~ Insidious Mind	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Supernatural	VISIBLE:DISPLAY	DESC:When it saves against a psychic or mind-affecting effect, the caster is exposed to seedborne consumption.	SOURCEPAGE:p.90
Seeded ~ Seedborne Consumption	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Supernatural.Attack	VISIBLE:DISPLAY	DESC:Fortitude save (DC 10 + 1/2 HD + Cha modifier); onset 1 month; frequency 1/month; effect 1d2 Cha damage that cannot be healed while infected; cure 3 consecutive saves. At Cha 0 the victim dies within 24 hours and rises as a seeded creature.	SOURCEPAGE:p.90
Seeded ~ Hive Telepathy	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Supernatural.Communicate	VISIBLE:DISPLAY	DESC:Telepathy 100 ft. with other seeded creatures only; gains morale bonuses from nearby seeded creatures. Not immune to charms, compulsions or mind-affecting effects from psychic sources.	SOURCEPAGE:p.90
